{"quest_id": 6223, "name": "浮沈の戦場", "description": "浮かんでは沈む船の残骸を足場に、\n魚人の襲撃を迎え撃て！\n＜遠距離ユニットのみ出撃可＞\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["遠距離ユニットのみ出撃可"], "event": "ゴールドラッシュ16(2017)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300158, "map_no": 5459, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 24, "params": [5], "expression": "IsRearguard() || IsClassType(1684);"}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["狙う", "ブロック不可", "水面"], "hp": 4200, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 4200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 120, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 80, "attack_speed": 150, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101136, "race_id": 7, "change_to": 1, "missile_id": 30, "missile": {"speed": 1.0}, "master_id": 658, "global_id": 657, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 348, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 4200, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 4200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 120, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_range": 130, "attack_speed": 180, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 361, "move_speed": 250.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101920, "race_id": 7, "missile_id": 30, "missile": {"speed": 1.0}, "master_id": 349, "global_id": 348, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 0}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 38, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["狙う", "ブロック不可", "水面"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 60, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 150, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101120, "race_id": 7, "special_effect_id": 229, "change_to": 3, "missile_id": 30, "missile": {"speed": 1.0}, "master_id": 657, "global_id": 656, "ranged": true, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 346, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 1500, "attack": 130, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 130, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 60, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 180, "attack_wait": 150, "attack_interval": 361, "move_speed": 250.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101888, "race_id": 7, "missile_id": 30, "missile": {"speed": 1.0}, "master_id": 347, "global_id": 346, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 0}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 76}], "popups": ["海中から浮かんでくる船の残骸は、\n時間経過により沈むことがあります。\n沈む船の残骸に配置していた\nユニットは撤退します。\n撤退後は再出撃が可能です。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "メル", "text": "…………王子達、まだかなぁ。", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "イブキ", "text": "ふふ……まさか演習に熱中しすぎて船が座礁、\n難破する事になるとは……。\n……すまない、少し熱くなりすぎたようだ。", "face": "u511"}, {"name": "フレデリカ", "text": "私もちょっと熱くなりすぎたわ。\n面目ないわね……。", "face": "u362"}, {"name": "クレア", "text": "港が近くだったのが不幸中の幸いだね。\n王子たちが助けを呼びに行ってるから、\nそれまではひとまず待機かな。", "face": "u30"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "折角水着を着てるっていうのに、なんだか暇ねぇ。\n……王子達が来るまで、ひと泳ぎしてこようかしら。\nポーラ、貴方も一緒にどう？", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "ポーラ", "text": "賛成です……と言いたいですが、\n今はやめた方が良さそうです。\nあっちを見るです。", "face": "u519"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "……？　\n……アレはッ！！", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "クレア", "text": "……どうやら魚人のようだね。\n狙いはこの船みたいだ、\n真っすぐこっちに向かってくる。", "face": "u30"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "もう、こんな時に！！", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "ポーラ", "text": "海を楽しむのは、あれを倒してからに\nするしかなさそうです……ただ、\n迎撃しようにも、足場が少ないですが。", "face": "u519"}, {"name": "クレア", "text": "浮き沈みしている船の残骸を使えば、\nなんとか足場に出来そうだけど……。", "face": "u30"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "浮いたり沈んだり不安定ね……\n……けど、それしか道もないみたい。", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "敵の動きをしっかり読んで\n動く必要がありそうね。\nみんな、行くわよ！", "face": "u517"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "クレア", "text": "どうにか片付いたみたいだね。", "face": "u30"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "はぁ……な、なんとかなったわね……。\nまさか、こんな状況で戦う事になるなんて\n思いもよらなかったわ。", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "ポーラ", "text": "船影がこっちに来るのが見えるです。\n王子達の助けが来たみたいです。", "face": "u519"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "予想外のハプニングもこれで終わりね。\n港についたら思いっきり遊ぶんだから！", "face": "u517"}, {"name": "ポーラ", "text": "エレインさん、まだまだ元気いっぱいですね。\n帰り着いたら、皆で遊ぶですよ。", "face": "u519"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map5459", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 19, "y": 311}, {"k": "m", "x": 77, "y": 335, "id": 200}, {"k": "r", "x": 145, "y": 457, "id": 300}], "events": [{"t": 13.4, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_08", "fx": "Ryuuboku3", "x": 378, "y": 497}]}, {"t": 14.3, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+s", "name": "locPlc_312", "id": 312, "k": "r", "x": 378, "y": 497}]}, {"t": 53.8, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_01", "fx": "Ryuuboku2", "x": 605, "y": 119}, {"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_02", "fx": "Ryuuboku3", "x": 494, "y": 140}, {"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_05", "fx": "Ryuuboku2", "x": 668, "y": 412}]}, {"t": 54.6, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+s", "name": "locPlc_303", "id": 303, "k": "r", "x": 494, "y": 140}, {"op": "+s", "name": "locPlc_304", "id": 304, "k": "r", "x": 563, "y": 111}, {"op": "+s", "name": "locPlc_305", "id": 305, "k": "r", "x": 634, "y": 100}, {"op": "+s", "name": "locPlc_308", "id": 308, "k": "